r_use.default_origin_policy.auto_review</code></div><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Type / Values</div><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">allow | deny</code></div><div><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Details</div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-default [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a]:text-link-color hover:[&amp;_a]:text-link-color-hover [&amp;_code]:rounded-sm [&amp;_code]:bg-surface-secondary [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[0.95em]">Use <code>deny</code> to skip automatic review on origins that use the fallback and ask the user for approval instead. <code>allow</code> leaves automatic review available when other settings allow it.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-default p-4 last:border-b-0 bg-surface-secondary"><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Key</div><code class="text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">browser_use.default_origin_policy.downloads</code></div><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Type / Values</div><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">allow | deny</code></div><div><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Details</div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-default [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a]:text-link-color hover:[&amp;_a]:text-link-color-hover [&amp;_code]:rounded-sm [&amp;_code]:bg-surface-secondary [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[0.95em]">Use <code>deny</code> to block Browser Use downloads on origins that use the fallback. <code>allow</code> only lets normal approval and policy checks continue.</div></div></div><div class="border-b border-default p-4 last:border-b-0 bg-surface"><di